===Minotaur===

=died1
#speaker:Athena
It's okay, we still have plenty of time — ironic, isn’t it? You’ve only just begun. Though losing to the Minotaur… you really outdid yourself.

#speaker:Apistos
Well, you know, when something’s angrily snorting right in your face, you kinda forget all about the cards.

#speaker:Athena
Next time, try growling back at him — who knows, maybe you’ll lose to something other than a card match.

#speaker:Apistos
I see you only wish the very best for me

#speaker:Athena
Sure thing, my little fish

#speaker:Apistos
If I didn't know, I’d never believe you were a goddess, your manners are atrocious, and your sense of humor… just as bad.

#speaker: Athena
Less words! Back to work!
->DONE

=died2
