#speaker:Apistos
So, you’re saying I’m just a poor, overworked guy to you?

#speaker: Athena
Poor? Nah, I think you’re pretty lucky to have me as your boss!

#speaker: Apistos
I’m seriously not so sure about that...

#speaker: Athena
