=died3
#speaker:Athena
You two had your little grudge match, and here you are again. Honestly, you’d be six feet under if it weren’t me. By the way, you and your bullheaded friend are starting to look like a real unlucky couple.

#speaker:Apistos
Being stuck with a huge, angry minotaur as a partner… yeah, that’s not exactly inspiring.
#speaker:Athena

Every creature deserves a partner, as you, mortals, say!

#speaker:Apistos
With that logic, I’d rather choose as a partner a really dumb salmon.

#speaker:Athena
Embracing your inner fishiness… how noble of you, Apistos!

#speaker:Apistos
Couldn’t be nobler…

#speaker:Athena
I promise, once you win the tournament, I’ll find you a salmon partner that suits you perfectly.
